# Trust-boundary violation (CWE-501): user input written into a trust context.

test "js: req body -> securityContext claim is a trust-boundary violation"
  lang javascript
  expect VYQL-CFG-014
  code
  ```
  function h(req, res) {
    const x = req.body.tenant;
    req.securityContext.claims.tenant = x;
  }
  ```

test "js: req body -> session property is a trust-boundary violation"
  lang javascript
  expect VYQL-CFG-014
  code
  ```
  function h(req, res) {
    const x = req.body.role;
    req.session.role = x;
  }
  ```

test "js: constant session write is clean (no FP)"
  lang javascript
  reject VYQL-CFG-014
  code
  ```
  function h(req, res) {
    req.session = req.session || {};
    req.session.role = "guest";
  }
  ```
